# iOS MDM Standards

- Manage iOS only through an MDM adapter (`MdmProviderPort`). Do not claim native MDM protocol completeness without a test environment.
- Do not assume the platform can supervise merchant devices without Apple Business authorization (Model A or B — see docs/device-management/TENANT-OWNERSHIP-MODELS.md).
- Do not require skipping passcode, Apple ID, Location Services, or other Setup Assistant privacy/security screens.
- Lost Mode is forbidden for debt collection. Emergency calling must remain available.
- Unsupported Android-equivalent actions return `UNSUPPORTED_CAPABILITY`; never fake parity.
- No secrets in enrollment instructions or QR stand-ins. Per-tenant MDM credentials in secret storage only.
- Mark production iOS management BLOCKED until ABM + MDM evidence exists.
